笑顔でいられる毎日を
These days where we can smile...

94
00:36:58,555 --> 00:37:00,655
誇りたい 信じたい
...I want to be proud of them, I want to believe in them.

95
00:37:00,655 --> 00:37:03,455
切り拓く未来
