120
00:38:42,855 --> 00:38:45,555
こうやって適度にいい子になるまで
Like this, until you become a moderately good child,

121
00:38:45,555 --> 00:38:47,155
愛してあげるね 大丈夫
I will love you, it's okay.

122
00:38:47,255 --> 00:38:48,655
どんどん 汚して 満たして
Keep dirtying and filling,

123
00:38:48,655 --> 00:38:50,555
全部 どこかに置いて 燃やして
leave it all somewhere and burn it.

124
00:38:50,555 --> 00:38:52,555
骨の髄まで ちゃんと奥まで
To the marrow of the bone, deep inside,

125
00:38:52,555 --> 00:38:54,355
愛 愛 愛 ラブ
Love, love, love, love.

126
00:39:09,655 --> 00:39:11,355
なりたい ありたい こっち足りない
Who I want to be, who I want to exist as, is not enough here,

127
00:39:11,355 --> 00:39:12,855
足りないままに 満たしたくなっちゃって
wanting to fill it while still incomplete.

128
00:39:12,855 --> 00:39:14,555
寂しいね 可愛いね
How lonely, how cute.

129
00:39:14,555 --> 00:39:17,355
お胸に映ったお友達も みんな全部
Even the friend reflected on your chest, everyone, everything.

130
00:39:17,455 --> 00:39:21,355
そう 指差して 言葉交わさず 撫で撫でしてあげるから
Yes, pointing fingers without exchanging words, because I'll pat your head.

131
00:39:21,355 --> 00:39:23,755
こっちおいで 愛嬌が上手だね
Come here, you're good at acting cute, aren't you?

132
00:39:23,755 --> 00:39:25,355
えっ えっ えっ やったね
Eh, eh, eh, you did it!

133
00:39:25,455 --> 00:39:26,455
息が吸えたね
You could breathe,

134
00:39:26,455 --> 00:39:27,455
息が吐けたね
you could exhale.

135
00:39:27,455 --> 00:39:28,755
独りだけで今日も過ごせたね
You spent today all by yourself again, didn't you?

136
00:39:28,755 --> 00:39:29,855
手が上手だね
You're good with your hands,

137
00:39:29,855 --> 00:39:30,955
口が上手だね
you're good with your mouth,

138
00:39:30,955 --> 00:39:32,355
泣いちゃったら すべて消えちゃうって
saying that if you cry, everything will disappear.

139
00:39:32,455 --> 00:39:33,755
悪夢がそうだから 忘れて 全て塗れなくちゃ
Because nightmares are like that, forget them and get smeared in everything.

140
00:39:33,755 --> 00:39:35,755
ありえないくらい 愛おしくて 愛おしくて たまらないけど
It's unbelievably lovely, so lovely I can't stand it, but...

141
00:39:35,755 --> 00:39:37,855
多分一発じゃ 届かないから 届かないから もう一回
probably a single shot won't reach, won't reach, so one more time.

142
00:39:37,855 --> 00:39:39,555
痛くたっていいから 痛くたっていいから
Even if it hurts, even if it hurts,

143
00:39:39,555 --> 00:39:40,855
言えることがいいよね
it's good to be able to say it, right?

144
00:39:40,955 --> 00:39:42,855
しゃあないね 気のせいじゃないもんね
It can't be helped, it's not just your imagination.

145
00:39:42,855 --> 00:39:44,655
しゃあないね しゃあないね
It can't be helped, it can't be helped.

146
00:39:44,655 --> 00:39:47,655
ねんねしたいよね もういっちょ
You want to go to sleep, don't you? One more time.

147
00:39:47,655 --> 00:39:49,355
しゃあないね しゃあないね
It can't be helped, it can't be helped.

148
00:39:49,355 --> 00:39:51,455
泣いても 泣いても 届かないね
Even if you cry and cry, it won't reach.

149
00:39:51,455 --> 00:39:53,355
しゃあないね しゃあないね
It can't be helped, it can't be helped.

150
00:39:53,355 --> 00:39:55,655
誰も返事しないもんね
Because nobody replies anyway.

151
00:39:57,355 --> 00:39:59,555
あわく あわく 妄想だらけ
Just faintly, faintly, full of delusions,

152
00:39:59,555 --> 00:40:00,855
傷つけたりしないで
please don't hurt me.

153
00:40:00,855 --> 00:40:02,655
こんな嘘だらけの世界になっちゃって ごめんね
I'm sorry it's become a world so full of lies.

154
00:40:04,351 --> 00:40:05,651
大丈夫
Don't worry,

155
00:40:05,651 --> 00:40:07,551
安全圏にようこそ
welcome to the safety zone.

156
00:40:07,551 --> 00:40:09,251
新しい世界に降臨
Descending into a brand-new world,

157
